{
  "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
  "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
  "records": [
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0000-0006",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 2,
        "start": 2
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "APPEARANCES:\nLUCAS M. WALKER, ESQUIRE, Washington, D.C.; on behalf of the Petitioners.\nMASHA G. HANSFORD, Assistant to the Solicitor General, Department of Justice, Washington, D.C.; for the United States, as amicus curiae, supporting neither party.\nMATTHEW S. HELLMAN, ESQUIRE, Washington, D.C.; on behalf of the Respondent."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0000-0002",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 6,
        "start": 6
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE THOMAS: Could you imagine any set of circumstances where a sale that involves an international transaction could also involve conduct in the United States that violates the Lanham Act?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0000-0003",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 7,
        "start": 7
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE SOTOMAYOR: I don't understand what that difference is from the sales to people in foreign countries who designated the United States as the mailing address. You know that they're buying it to ship it into the U.S. Why aren't you aiding and abetting? And isn't that an effect as direct as the Lanham Act can ask for? You're interfering with commerce in the United States."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Barrett",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0000-0004",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 12,
        "start": 12
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE BARRETT: Would Steele come out the same way today?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0001-0003",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 32,
        "start": 32
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "ORAL ARGUMENT OF MASHA G. HANSFORD FOR THE UNITED STATES, AS AMICUS CURIAE, SUPPORTING NEITHER PARTY"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Jackson",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0002-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 44,
        "start": 44
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "BUT WAIT. WHY DOES IT TURN ON WHAT THE SELLER INTENDS IN THAT WAY? I MEAN, I HAD UNDERSTOOD THAT AT LEAST IN SOME -- THAT SOME COMMENTATORS THOUGHT THIS -- THAT THIS STATUTE, THE LANHAM ACT STATUTE, WAS SORT OF A STRICT LIABILITY STATUTE. SO, IF THE 10 TURN UP ON THE STREET IN MANHATTAN AND THEY'RE BEING SOLD AND CAUSING CUSTOMER CONFUSION, DOES IT MATTER WHETHER THE MANUFACTURER KNEW THAT, INTENDED THAT, THOUGHT THAT? WHY -- WHY DOES THAT MATTER?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0003-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 65,
        "start": 65
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE THOMAS: What are the limits of your argument? Let's -- you know, the -- consider the application of your rule to purely foreign transactions."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Hellman",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0003-0001",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 66,
        "start": 66
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "First of all, in the real world, if you'll allow me, personal jurisdiction is going to be an absolute bar to many, many cases. But then, just with respect to the Lanham Act itself, there are multiple considerations, multiple bars. The effect needs to be substantial. Insubstantial effects don't count."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0003-0002",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 67,
        "start": 67
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE THOMAS: I think I'm --I think I'm a bit more interested in your effects test. You said substantial effects. And we see how extensive and how broadly that test is used in domestic commerce clause cases."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Hellman",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0003-0003",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 68,
        "start": 68
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "those kinds of uses of the mark that are incidental, that aren't particularly close, versus the ones that are intended to get something very valuable from that plaintiff mark-holder."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0003-0004",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 70,
        "start": 70
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE KAVANAUGH: What would you say to the EU brief?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Alito",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0003-0005",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 71,
        "start": 71
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE ALITO: Do you agree that the world takes a territorial approach to trademark law?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Alito",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0003-0006",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 73,
        "start": 73
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE ALITO: But how does that fit with your substantial effects and proximate cause test?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Jackson",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0003-0007",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 74,
        "start": 74
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE JACKSON: So can I ask you just in terms of your liability principles here"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Jackson",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0003-0008",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 75,
        "start": 75
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE JACKSON: But Congress can't regulate foreign commerce, correct?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Jackson",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0003-0010",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 77,
        "start": 77
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE JACKSON: I'm just saying confusion caused by products that are made and kept overseas."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Alito",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0003-0012",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 79,
        "start": 79
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE ALITO: Why didn't -- why didn't you sue in Germany?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "International Trademark Association",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0003-0013",
      "kind": "amicus_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 82,
        "start": 82
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "That is the INTA brief, the International Trademark Association's brief. They, along with the other trademark associations in this case, all say that the Act should apply extraterritorially."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0003-0014",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 83,
        "start": 83
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Justice Gorsuch, I heard your suggestion that perhaps you look to when the Act or when a claim accrues as understanding when the focus might come into --come into focus."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0003-0016",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 85,
        "start": 85
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE SOTOMAYOR: So it's not the product that caused confusion, it was the acts of the Petitioner, because the Petitioner was representing they were you, is that it?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0004-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 86,
        "start": 86
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "I -- I -- I guess I didn't fully understand your point. Your point is, if they hadn't told the world that they were you, those customers would have come to you?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Petitioners",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0004-0002",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 86,
        "start": 86
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The Lanham Act reaches infringing uses of a mark. A use is not just a sale. A use is, to quote the statute, \"the offering for sale, the distribution or advertising of the good.\""
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Jackson",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0004-0001",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 87,
        "start": 87
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "And even if that trade show is in Germany?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0004-0003",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 93,
        "start": 93
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "It requires a domestic use of the mark in commerce within the United States."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Government",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-18539521244d-0004-0004",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 95,
        "start": 95
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Going to the government's test, I originally thought from their briefing that they said use the likelihood-of-confusion test that we already use to determine liability, that 13-factor or seven-factor test. But now they say it actually needs to be actual confusion, not just a likelihood of confusion."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Source extraction",
      "case_id": "2022-21-1043",
      "confidence": 0.0,
      "document_hash": "18539521244dfdc6dbc5eaa13c927f31de1e7f238f38cb614cbf33882b171ba2",
      "evidence_id": "unavailable-18539521244d-97",
